    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/329d0d5cb88ec88796faf4cae95c119d.avif?t=1748451365\" width=560 height=282 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/ea70ad8eab520143c7048394cb1b06ac.webp?t=1748451365\" width=770 height=31 /></span><br>A mysterious cold spell traps you in your cozy home. Your old dog Jedediah is sick and to top it all off, the heating suddenly breaks! Will you dare to enter a cursed world to fix it?<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.poster.avif?t=1748451365\" width=165 height=133 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.webm?t=1748451365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/2c2c43f973851a392c710a88581652e5.webp?t=1748451365\" width=770 height=31 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short and sweet <strong>Liminal Adventure Game</strong>, with dashes of CRPG.<br></li><li>Talk to the people of Snow Cone, unravel a <strong>mind-bending mystery</strong>.<br></li><li>Succeed or fail in spicy situations with a <strong>roll of the dice</strong>. Failing is half the fun!<br></li><li>Choose your Mood to get a bonus on some rolls:<br></li><li>Be <i>Empathic</i> - Sense your way around a conversation with compassion &amp; charisma!<br></li><li>Be <i>Logical</i> - Use reason and deduction to your advantage!<br></li><li>Be <i>Ruthless</i> - Confront things with some good ol' brute force!<br></li><li>An experimental, synth-heavy soundtrack with bleeps and bloops.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/329d0d5cb88ec88796faf4cae95c119d.avif?t=1748451365\" width=560 height=282 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/ea70ad8eab520143c7048394cb1b06ac.webp?t=1748451365\" width=770 height=31 /></span><br>A mysterious cold spell traps you in your cozy home. Your old dog Jedediah is sick and to top it all off, the heating suddenly breaks! Will you dare to enter a cursed world to fix it?<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.poster.avif?t=1748451365\" width=165 height=133 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/99e7a5816881a97ab29db6d0085ae70f.webm?t=1748451365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784660/extras/2c2c43f973851a392c710a88581652e5.webp?t=1748451365\" width=770 height=31 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short and sweet <strong>Liminal Adventure Game</strong>, with dashes of CRPG.<br></li><li>Talk to the people of Snow Cone, unravel a <strong>mind-bending mystery</strong>.<br></li><li>Succeed or fail in spicy situations with a <strong>roll of the dice</strong>. Failing is half the fun!<br></li><li>Choose your Mood to get a bonus on some rolls:<br></li><li>Be <i>Empathic</i> - Sense your way around a conversation with compassion &amp; charisma!<br></li><li>Be <i>Logical</i> - Use reason and deduction to your advantage!<br></li><li>Be <i>Ruthless</i> - Confront things with some good ol' brute force!<br></li><li>An experimental, synth-heavy soundtrack with bleeps and bloops.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Snow Cone Serenade is a short and sweet liminal adventure. Choose your mood and roll the dice to succeed or fail in spicy situations. Enter a cursed snow world to save your sick dog, Jedediah. Unravel a mind-bending mystery to face your innermost fears.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German",
    "reviews": "\u201cDespite being only an hour long, Snow Cone Serenade makes every second count through meticulously crafted character interactions which, while brief, have notable growth and development that is profoundly impactful.\u201d<br>Arcweave<br>",
